OL,3,GNEWSA'Lip King unbothered' when mum
OL,4,Acollapsed after BBL
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who carried out a cosmetic
OL,7,Fprocedure which an expert said had led
OL,8,Fto a woman's death complained he was
OL,9,F"exhausted" and seemed "unbothered"
OL,10,Fwhen paramedics arrived, an inquest has
OL,11,Fbeen told.
OL,13,FMother-of-five Alice Webb, 33,
OL,14,Fcollapsed at a friend's house in
OL,15,FGloucester on 23 September 2024 and
OL,16,Fdied the following day after having a
OL,17,FBrazilian Butt Lift (BBL).
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
