OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1795029944
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Lip King unbothered' when mum
OL,4,Acollapsed after BBL
OL,5,
OL,6,FJordan Parke, known as the "Lip King",
OL,7,Fgave Webb seven times the recommended
OL,8,Famount of filler before she collapsed.
OL,9,FHe was under investigation for gross
OL,10,Fnegligence manslaughter when he died in
OL,11,F2026.
OL,13,FEarlier, an expert pathologist told
OL,14,FWebb's inquest that a "gel-like" liquid
OL,15,Fhad been found in blood vessels in her
OL,16,Fbrain, lungs and heart.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
